  "policy": [
    "动态collection day与原工厂第一次day仍独立读取；原envelope/context/三来源字段终态；alias自身坏隔离；earliest预算与回退不复活。",
    "原create后新增scope→phase/day/gameOver→World permit完整域读；纯租约拒绝return整collection；null/无效工具仍continue。",
    "provider/publication callee和完整参数及新增Reflect.apply.bind观察都在末guard前准备；发表返回后唯一true；不回滚sink先写后throw。",
    "原permit.close盖body，false通知仅无旧错时传播；failed boolean保throw undefined。"
  ]
